      "chunk_id": "prose_p_1",
      "text": "OAKLAND, Calif., May  08, 2024  (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ContextLogic Inc. (Nasdaq: WISH) (\u201cContextLogic,\u201d the \u201cCompany,\u201d \u201cwe\u201d or \u201cour\u201d) today reported its financial results for the quarter ended March 31, 2024.",
