    {
      "chunk_id": "prose_p_7",
      "text": "As a result of Asset Sale, the Company had approximately $161 million in cash, cash equivalents and marketable securities (consisting of government securities) immediately following the closing of that transaction (\u201cPost-Closing Cash\u201d), as well as the NOLs and other tax attributes described above.\u00a0 As required by the Asset Purchase Agreement, the Buyer assumed substantially all of our liabilities at closing.",
