    {
      "chunk_id": "prose_p_3",
      "text": "Prior to the April\u202f19,\u202f2024 closing of the Asset Sale described below, ContextLogic owned and operated the Wish platform, a mobile ecommerce platform.\u00a0 As a result of the Asset Sale, ContextLogic no longer owns the Wish platform or any of the related operating assets.\u00a0 Since the Asset Sale was not completed until after the end of the first quarter, the financial results described below do not reflect the impact of the Asset Sale or our post-closing operations.",
